# The shared libc entry table for ABI 2 (spec Phase 2b, R2b.9, J.3).
#
# One function per line; the line number (from 0, comments and blank lines
# not counted) is its slot in the table at the start of the library in
# flash (<minix/shlibc.h>).  FROZEN: never reorder, insert or remove a name
# while GZ_ABI stays 2 - a program built today calls slot n forever.  New
# libc functions go at the END (tools/mkshlibc.py tells you which).
#
# Started 2026-11-16 with every global function of the shared members,
# sorted by name.
__aeabi_idiv0
__aeabi_ldiv0
__aeabi_ldivmod
__aeabi_uldivmod
__bad_assertion
__cleanup
__execve
__exit
__fillbuf
__flushbuf
__newsigset
__oldsigset
__sigreturn
__udivmoddi4
__vfork_err
